    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the following Order issued by the Honorable Minister of Finance, by virtue of the power vested inhim by Section 32 read with Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) as amended from time to time, and published inthe Extraordinary Gazette No. 1956/19 of 02.03.2016 effective from 01.04.2016, was passed by Parliament on 19.05.2016.",
